sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-user-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-user-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CTRL as Controller (ipm-user-controller)
  participant ZIT as Zitadel (UserService / OrgService)

  U->>API: POST /v1/ipm/users {organizationId, email, givenName, familyName, roles, groups}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, permissão ipm.user.create, bind e catálogo
  API->>API: valida organização via projeção local (Informer de ipm.organization)
  API->>DB: Transação SQL: INSERT ipm.user (Pending), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource: phase Pending, generation 1)
  P->>DB: drena outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.user.<id>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired.changed (Informer -> Workqueue)
  CTRL->>DB: lê intenção vigente no SSOT
  CTRL->>CTRL: resolve permissões efetivas a partir dos catálogos em memória (roles/groups)
  CTRL->>ZIT: observa se o usuário já existe na organização
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 404 Not Found (absent)
  CTRL->>ZIT: cria usuário humano, adiciona membership e concede userGrant no Project Grant
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK
  CTRL->>ZIT: reobserva usuário e roles concedidas
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK (present, ativo)
  CTRL->>DB: UPDATE ipm.user SET phase = Ready, observed_generation = generation
